WEBVTT

00:06:28.902 --> 00:06:31.340
that situation would look
a lot like driving.

00:06:31.364 --> 00:06:32.359
(Laughter)

00:06:32.383 --> 00:06:33.541
It's true.

00:06:33.565 --> 00:06:35.732
You are, by definition,
on your way somewhere,

00:06:35.756 --> 00:06:40.333
so everything that happens -- traffic,
other drivers, road construction --

00:06:40.357 --> 00:06:42.505
it feels like it's blocking your goals.

00:06:42.529 --> 00:06:45.720
There are all these written
and unwritten rules of the road,

00:06:45.744 --> 00:06:48.998
and those rules are routinely violated
right in front of you,

00:06:49.022 --> 00:06:50.537
usually without consequence.

00:06:50.561 --> 00:06:52.307
And who's violating those rules?

00:06:52.331 --> 00:06:54.926
Anonymous others,
people you will never see again,

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:58.085
making them a very easy target
for your wrath.

00:06:58.109 --> 00:06:59.887
(Laughter)

00:06:59.911 --> 00:07:03.607
So you're driving somewhere,
thus teed up to be angry,